  "sentences": [
   {
    "n": 1,
    "text": "By the team's ranking, the investigations closest to a cotton fabric in a lunar base are SAFFIRE-II (PSI-99), SAFFIRE-I (PSI-98) and ACME BRE (PSI-20).",
    "facts": [
     "F1"
    ],
    "origin": "model",
    "status": "repaired"
   },
   {
    "n": 2,
    "text": "Solid-fuel tests in the team's tables record the oxygen of the surrounding atmosphere for 139 of 376 tests, from 13.6 to 22.2%, so the 30% of this environment is above the highest recorded value.",
    "facts": [
     "F17"
    ],
    "origin": "model",
    "status": "kept"
   },
   {
    "n": 3,
    "text": "Solid-fuel tests record pressure for 0 of 376 tests, so the 70.3 kPa of this environment is not comparable with a recorded value.",
    "facts": [
     "F18"
    ],
    "origin": "model",
    "status": "kept"
   },
   {
    "n": 4,
    "text": "For extinction conditions, 17 of the 298 counted tests were recorded with oxygen and pressure both inside this environment's ranges, while none of the 133 tests counted for the flammability limit was.",
    "facts": [
     "F13",
     "F10"
    ],
    "origin": "model",
    "status": "kept"
   }
  ],
  "removed": [
   {
